e><div class=3D"product-entry__content prose prose-lg article-content"><p>T=
racker is a Go implementation of strongDM=E2=80=99s <a href=3D"https://gith=
ub.com/strongdm/attractor">Attractor</a> framework =E2=80=94 a three-layer =
system for building AI-powered software factories. You define workflows as =
DOT files =E2=80=94 directed acyclic graphs where each node is a step =E2=
=80=94 and Tracker executes them in dependency order. It handles human-in-t=
he-loop gates, LLM-powered nodes, automatic checkpointing, and retry logic.=
 A bubbletea TUI dashboard shows pipeline progress in real time.</p><h2 id=
